- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/staff-domain/multiple-care
  route: staff-domain/multiple-care
  key: multiple-care
  '@type':
  - skos:Concept
  - dwp:Circumstance
  label: Caring for several people
  definition: One person caring for several people is distinct from several carers for one person. DMG 60044
    refers to care for one qualifying person and must be read with 60043.
  aliases:
